# [CORE](../wg/core.html)

## Summary

The Constrained RESTful Environments (CoRE) Working Group held an interim meeting to discuss two main technical items:
1. A proposal for a new CoAP response code (2.06 No Content) to cleanly represent resources that exist but currently carry no representation, addressing issues identified during AD review of the CoAP PubSub specification.
2. An update on CORECONF (COMI) open issues, pull requests, and implementation feedback, as well as a brief status check on `draft-ietf-core-yang-metadata`.

